 "<div><b>Ir a la vista de esta diapositiva</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8f9bb3\">arrive: 'view'</div>": "<div><b>Ir para a vista deste diapositivo</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8f9bb3\">arrive: 'view'</div>",
